&lt;p&gt;BeyondTrust is a place where you can bring your purpose to life through the work that you do, creating a safer world through our cybersecurity SaaS portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture of flexibility, trust, and continual learning means you will be recognized for your growth, and for the impact you make on our success. You will be surrounded by people who challenge, support, and inspire you to be the best version of yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW165650421 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW165650421 BCX8&quot;&gt;The VP, Partner Ecosystems owns the strategy, architecture, and health of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW165650421 BCX8&quot;&gt;BeyondTrust&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW165650421 BCX8&quot;&gt; partner ecosystem — resellers, distributors, technology alliances, MSSPs, and cloud/marketplace partners. Reporting to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW165650421 BCX8&quot;&gt;SVP Global &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW165650421 BCX8&quot;&gt;Partnerships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW165650421 BCX8&quot;&gt;, this role builds and leads the team and programs that turn partners into a predictable, scalable growth engine, working closely with Sales, Marketing, Product, and Customer Success to align partner strategy with company revenue goals. The ideal candidate brings 10+ years of progressive partnerships, channel, or alliances leadership experience in enterprise cybersecurity or SaaS, with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW165650421 BCX8&quot;&gt;a track record&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW165650421 BCX8&quot;&gt; of designing partner programs that scale sourced and co-sold revenue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW165650421 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ecosystem Strategy: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define and own execution of the overall partner ecosystem strategy for resellers, distributors, technology/ISV alliances, MSSPs, and cloud marketplaces aligned to partner growth targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Program Alignment &amp;amp; Governance: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build and evolve partner tiering focus and execution against partner program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Revenue Growth: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own ecosystem revenue targets; drive partner-influenced and partner-originated bookings, expansion, and retention across the portfolio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Team Leadership: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hire, lead, and develop a team of partner/alliance managers; set goals, coach performance, and build a scalable organizational structure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strategic Alliances: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive field execution of go-to-market alliances that extend BeyondTrust&#39;s platform value and market reach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Alignment: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner with Sales, Marketing, Product, and Customer Success to embed partner motion into pipeline generation, launches, and renewals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Business Reviews &amp;amp; Forecasting: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Run executive and quarterly business reviews with top partners and align to support sales in opportunity management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Enablement: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ensure partners are trained, certified, and equipped with the tools and content needed to sell and support BeyondTrust solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ecosystem Health &amp;amp; Metrics: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define and track KPIs (partner-sourced revenue, GRR/NRR, partner activation) and report results to executive leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Market Representation: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Represent BeyondTrust at partner and industry events, and serve as an executive sponsor for strategic partner relationships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience in partnerships, channel sales, or alliances, including 5+ years in a senior leadership role, ideally in cybersecurity or enterprise SaaS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proven track record building and scaling partner ecosystems that deliver measurable, sourced/co-sold revenue growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience negotiating and structuring partner agreements, incentive programs, and tiered partner models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong people-leadership experience: hiring, developing, and managing a distributed partnerships/alliances team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of channel go-to-market models (VAR, VAD, MSSP, technology alliances, cloud marketplaces).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Executive-level communication and relationship-building skills, with experience presenting to C-level partners and internal leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Fluency with CRM and partner-management tooling (Salesforce, PRM platforms) and data-driven forecasting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Willingness and ability to travel domestically/internationally to support partner and industry engagements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in privileged access management, identity security, or broader cybersecurity markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Prior experience launching a partner program or ecosystem function from the ground up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with cloud marketplace partnerships (AWS, Azure, GCP Marketplace).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;MBA or equivalent advanced business experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Better Together&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity. Inclusion. They’re more than just words for us. They are the guiding values of how we build our teams, cultivate leaders, and create a culture where people feel connected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We take care of our employees so they can take care of our customers. Customers who come from all walks of life just like us. We hire incredible people from diverse backgrounds because when we are different together, we are stronger together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;About Us&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BeyondTrust is the global identity security leader protecting Paths to Privilege™. Our identity-centric approach goes beyond securing privileges and access, empowering organizations with the most effective solution to manage the entire identity attack surface and neutralize threats, whether from external attacks or insiders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BeyondTrust is leading the charge in transforming identity security to prevent breaches and limit the blast radius of attacks, while creating a superior customer experience and operational efficiencies. We are trusted by 20,000 customers, including 75 of the Fortune 100, and our global ecosystem of partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.beyondtrust.com/&quot;&gt;www.beyondtrust.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
